-cli","clan_summary":"[bold #D75FFF]◆ EPIC bob-cli-mc[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]Ctrl+W N — numbered tab hints and an in-place tab jump[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]In Bob's Obsidian, every main-area tab carries a quiet numeral [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim](1–9, in reading order across splits) beside its title, and Ctrl+W [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]followed by that digit focuses exactly that tab where it lives — [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]selected inside its own split, never moved, cloned, or reopened — [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]while the numerals brighten into accent key caps when the Ctrl+W [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]card appears and the destination numeral flashes once to confirm [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]the jump.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]5[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202611/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]obsidian_ctrl_w_numbered_tab_jump.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202611/obsidian_ctrl_w_numbered_tab_jump.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-mc[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-mc/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Tab catalog, digit planner, and main-area enumeration[/bold #D7AFFF]         [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]model[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]model: add the pure tab catalog, digit normalization, focus-tab planner,[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]numeral visibility verdict, and view-model tab data, plus read-only [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]main-area and hotkey readers that do not need a main-area active leaf.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]In-place tab-jump executor[/bold #D7AFFF]                                    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]actions[dim] · [dim][/dim]after model[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]actions: execute focus-tab plans losslessly (load if deferred, session [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]check, setActiveLeaf, invariants, restore), fold the selectedTab fix [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]through the move executor, and prove it on real Obsidian with a new e2e [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]tabs group.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Tab numerals, card tabs row, and previews[/bold #D7AFFF]                     [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]paint[dim] · [dim][/dim]after model[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]paint: build the dormant tab-numeral stamper and CSS (idle, lit, here, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]flash, stacked) and the card's pill ranges and tabs row, with a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]light/dark preview harness and unit tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Digits in the Ctrl+W prefix, palette commands, go live[/bold #D7AFFF]        [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]prefix[dim] · [dim][/dim]after actions, paint[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]prefix: wire digits into the Ctrl+W state machine with an armed-catalog [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]freeze, light the numerals with the card, flash on success, add Jump to [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]tab 1–9 commands, flip the dormant seams, bump the minor version, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]prove it on real Obsidian.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Docs, visual acceptance, and polish[/bold #D7AFFF]                           [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]finish[dim] · [dim][/dim]after prefix[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]finish: document digits and numerals on the Window keys page, run [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]real-Obsidian visual acceptance in light and dark, fix every polish [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]issue, and sync.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-mc","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-6-luna","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-mc.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-3fbce0bbc83dd4c21d095fbe3110f9a6","started_at":"2026-11-16T16:02:20.397682+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"51a0cd5705a260f80ea22ce830ea16ba9aa0ba6292a8c10357c8e133e92636cb","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-mc.land/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"meta":{"digest":"05a578f49d88988f6a90e426d58e760a3402409bb5df8e049e146150f76b7cb6","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-mc.land/meta.json","size_bytes":716},"prompt":{"digest":"0228a3642c9eda6d3d433b11b7cc6df2a7d3e43eb337d113409d4743277bb445","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-mc.land/prompt.md","size_bytes":309},"state":{"digest":"f2aa59eb905da0128f5495323b8536ee995236e5b02df1b15f72ecaa9c10e0c5","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-mc.land/state.json","size_bytes":163}},"finished_at":null,"global_name":"bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-mc.land","local_name":"bob-cli-mc.land","metadata":{"agent_clan":"bob-cli-mc","agent_clan_generation":"20261116110152","bead_id":"bob-cli-mc","changespec_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","cl_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-mc","llm_provider":"claude","model":"opus","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub","wait_for_beads":["bob-cli-mc.1","bob-cli-mc.2","bob-cli-mc.3","bob-cli-mc.4","bob-cli-mc.5"]},"source_run_id":"run-c4758da659a562a012d03b275d69dd87","starte